617
01:28:31,116 --> 01:28:32,200
Eu tive uma idéia.

618
01:28:56,283 --> 01:28:57,283
Mamãe?

619
01:29:00,366 --> 01:29:01,366
Papai.

620
01:29:04,241 --> 01:29:05,283
Papai!

621
01:29:26,741 --> 01:29:27,783
Mamãe?

622
01:29:30,325 --> 01:29:31,616
Está tudo bem, mamãe.

623
01:29:36,700 --> 01:29:37,783
Mamãe!

624
01:29:38,158 --> 01:29:39,866
Não!

625
01:30:34,408 --> 01:30:35,783
Vamos!

626
01:30:45,616 --> 01:30:46,783
Mamãe!

627
01:30:48,491 --> 01:30:49,533
Mãe!

628
01:31:03,033 --> 01:31:03,750
Para!

629
01:31:03,825 --> 01:31:04,866
Mãe!

630
01:31:08,616 --> 01:31:09,700
Mamãe!

631
01:31:13,700 --> 01:31:14,783
Por favor.

632
01:31:27,616 --> 01:31:28,700
Mamãe.

633
01:33:49,366 --> 01:33:51,033
Querida, abra,
eu tenho café pra você.

634
01:33:59,533 --> 01:34:00,616
Kate.

635
01:34:15,783 --> 01:34:16,783
Kate.

636
